{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The latest installment of the physics-based puzzle sensation 'Q REMASTERED,' which took off primarily among Japanese streamers, is now on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's 'Q \uff57ith VTubers'!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> This time, Q features challenging and quirky puzzles designed by over 20 VTubers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've prepared new challenges for humanity, who have already succeeded in getting a ball out of a cup and hanging a hanger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embracing the charm of 'Q REMASTERED,' this is a challenge from VTubers who have experienced 'Q' to all of humanity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As always, the solutions are entirely free and up to you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the new Q \u2013 simple 'yet' difficult.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502720?t=1744343103","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502720/eb20c5b2c15bc35af43c8ed38fe3617de452b0ed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744343103","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502720/d47dd3969b4e0451f354387623fe9edf116cee7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744343103","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502720/d47dd3969b4e0451f354387623fe9edf116cee7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744343103","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The latest installment of the physics-based puzzle sensation 'Q REMASTERED,' which took off primarily among Japanese streamers, is now on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's 'Q \uff57ith VTubers'!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> This time, Q features challenging and quirky puzzles designed by over 20 VTubers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've prepared new challenges for humanity, who have already succeeded in getting a ball out of a cup and hanging a hanger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embracing the charm of 'Q REMASTERED,' this is a challenge from VTubers who have experienced 'Q' to all of humanity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As always, the solutions are entirely free and up to you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the new Q \u2013 simple 'yet' difficult.</p>","developers":["liica, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502720/6530348c10f0647394933a827dcb1952367f6fdd/header.jpg?t=1744343103","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257119059,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119059/movie480.mp4?t=1743125360","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119059/movie_max.mp4?t=1743125360"},"name":"\u30d7\u30ed\u30e2\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u30e0\u30fc\u30d3\u30fc02 EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119059/d095b345de4d9e6833d177d71a6e4abb7108d8b3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743125360","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.